{{trans-bottom}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|head=pro forma|-}}

# [[undertaken|Undertaken]] or [[performed]] as a [[perfunctory]] matter, in the interest of [[form]], or for the [[sake]] of [[politeness]].
#: {{ux|en|He greeted her '''pro forma'''.}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=pro forma}}

# A [[document]] that shows the standard entries of a [[form]] or similar document.

